          "question": {
            "text": "The density of a certain gas at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>30</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>768</mn></math> torr is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>,&nbsp;then density of the gas at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>STP</mi></math> is",
