              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>",
